 7. 🤖 Thanksgiving sous-chef 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Illustration: Sarah Grillo/Axios. Stock: Getty Images

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 More Americans are turning to AI for Thanksgiving dinner help, Axios' Avery Lotz writes. 

 Campbell's recent State of the Sides survey found that 27% of U.S. adults who celebrate Thanksgiving have used generative AI for holiday planning or cooking, up from 22% last year. 65% of shoppers say they would like to use AI in some aspect of holiday meal planning, according to the Food Industry Association's holiday shopper trend research . Go deeper . 

 
 
